    A Grayspeak Textbook
    ​[italic]By Taikondy Roga Numbytoo[/italic]


    —


    Oum, again! 


    This is the second chapter of the NanoTrasen Sponsored Series “Oum Erth!” Since the chapters are being published in volumes, try asking your librarian if you can find the other chapters!


    While the first chapter is not mandatory reading, some topics and concepts will not be re-explained. Part of language learning is properly building the blocks bit by bit. Review is helpful, but to reach higher heights you need to be able to reach out from your base!


    Yet, at the same time, there is no “proper” way to build a base. If you believe you are ready for this chapter, please give it a try.


